The 
downturn in real estate damaged his family finances and is a circumstance largely 
beyond his control;

Available information requires application of the disqualifying conditions at AG ¶¶ 
19(a) (inability to satisfy debts); 19(b) (unwillingness to satisfy debts regardless of the 
ability to do so);

Behaving responsibly or irresponsibly in one aspect of life provides an indication of how
a person may behave in other aspects of life. (31) Applicant's delinquent debts brings the matter within Financial
Consideration Disqualifying Conditions Directive ¶ E2.A6.1.2.2 (history of not meeting financial obligations);
